{
    "title": "Take Off Bolts: Screw Puzzle",
    "description": "Take Off Bolts: Screw Puzzle is a free screw puzzle game suitable for players of all ages! This engaging game is designed not only to challenge your problem-solving abilities but also to provide you with an exciting puzzle adventure that you won't want to put down.\r\nHow To Play\r\nChoose a bolt and tap to move it that make all metal plates fall.\ud83d\udd29\ud83d\udd13\r\n\u2022 Think carefully. Unlocking order determines your success, a wrong choice will lead you to a dead end.\ud83e\udd14\ud83d\udca1\r\n\u2022 Use boosters to help you complete levels more easily. \ud83d\ude06\ud83d\ude80\r\n\u2022 Reset the level if you get stuck.\ud83d\udd04\ud83e\udde0\r\nGame Features\r\n\u2022 Unique levels: Hundreds of challenging levels await you, you will play this screw game with easy or hard mode.\ud83e\udde9\ud83d\ude00\r\n\u2022 Powerful Tools: Make use of power-ups to help you complete the game.  From screwdrivers that remove screws to bombs that blow up metal plates, these tools are the key to your victory in the game.\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udcaa\r\n\u2022 Time-Limited Challenges: Race against the clock to remove all metal plates before time runs out.\u231b\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\r\n\u2022 Easy control: With just one finger tap to operate,  enjoy an easy-to-learn gameplay mechanic that ensures everyone can get started.\ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc46\r\nContact Us\r\n\ud83c\udf89Thanks for selecting our puzzle game! We will make the game even better.\r\n\ud83d\udce9If you encounter any issues during the screw puzzle game, you can send us feedback via email: playfulbytesstudio@gmail.com\r\n\ud83d\udc4cAre you ready to become a screw master? Take Off Bolts: Screw Puzzle invites you on a delightful journey filled with intricate puzzles and memorable moments!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take Off Bolts: Screw Puzzle is a free screw puzzle game suitable for players of all ages! This engaging game is designed not only to challenge your problem-solving abilities but also to provide you with an exciting puzzle adventure that you won&#39;t want to put down.<br>How To Play<br>Choose a bolt and tap to move it that make all metal plates fall.\ud83d\udd29\ud83d\udd13<br>\u2022 Think carefully. Unlocking order determines your success, a wrong choice will lead you to a dead end.\ud83e\udd14\ud83d\udca1<br>\u2022 Use boosters to help you complete levels more easily. \ud83d\ude06\ud83d\ude80<br>\u2022 Reset the level if you get stuck.\ud83d\udd04\ud83e\udde0<br>Game Features<br>\u2022 Unique levels: Hundreds of challenging levels await you, you will play this screw game with easy or hard mode.\ud83e\udde9\ud83d\ude00<br>\u2022 Powerful Tools: Make use of power-ups to help you complete the game.  From screwdrivers that remove screws to bombs that blow up metal plates, these tools are the key to your victory in the game.\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udcaa<br>\u2022 Time-Limited Challenges: Race against the clock to remove all metal plates before time runs out.\u231b\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3<br>\u2022 Easy control: With just one finger tap to operate,  enjoy an easy-to-learn gameplay mechanic that ensures everyone can get started.\ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc46<br>Contact Us<br>\ud83c\udf89Thanks for selecting our puzzle game! We will make the game even better.<br>\ud83d\udce9If you encounter any issues during the screw puzzle game, you can send us feedback via email: playfulbytesstudio@gmail.com<br>\ud83d\udc4cAre you ready to become a screw master? Take Off Bolts: Screw Puzzle invites you on a delightful journey filled with intricate puzzles and memorable moments!",
